'pragmat'module=sortdown,title="descending sort".
$ quicksort in descending order
'a'sort reverse+[]T[]. $ exported sorting algorithm

'pragmat'if=compile. $ module body starts here
'pragmat'require="qsort". $ the sorting algorithm is defined here

'a'sort reverse+[]T[]: quick sort+<<T+>>T+T.

'q'qsort::qless+>x+>y: x>y.

'root'+.
'pragmat'endif=compile.
